# ...EXCEPT benchmark transcripts, which are primary evidence, not logs.
#
# `*.log` above silently excluded every session transcript in benchmark/runs/. Those files are the
# only record of HOW a number was produced — which tools the model called, what it read, where the
# turns went. Every claim in STRATA-QUALITY-BENCH.md is re-derivable from them and from nothing else,
# so a repo without them holds conclusions that cannot be checked. They are ~150 KB each.
!benchmark/runs/**/*.log
report.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.json

